# 🌱 MoodTrack – Personal Wellness Tracker

MoodTrack is a personal wellness tracking web application designed to help users understand their daily mood and stress patterns.

## ✨ Features

* 😊 Daily Mood Tracking
* 🌿 Stress Level Tracking
* 📊 Weekly Mood Analytics
* 📝 Personal Journal
* 🧘 Breathing Exercise
* 🌙 Dark and Light Mode
* 👤 User Profile
* ⚙️ App Settings
* 📱 Responsive Design

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript
* Chart.js
* LocalStorage

## 💡 About the Project

MoodTrack helps users record their daily moods, monitor stress levels, write personal journal entries, and view their weekly progress through interactive charts.

All entries are stored locally in the browser using LocalStorage.

